$3 \\log_{\\frac{1}{3}} a$ при $a = 2\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$", "key": "$-1{,}5$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_8_2", "current_skill": "G10_S17_02", "q": "Вычислите значение выражения $3 \\log_{\\frac{1}{3}} a$ при $a = \\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$", "key": "$\\dfrac{-3}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_8_3", "current_skill": "G10_S17_02", "q": "Вычислите значение выражения $4 \\log_3 a$ при $a = \\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)$", "key": "$2$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_9", "current_skill": "G10_S17_02", "q": "Если $a = \\sin \\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$, то найдите $\\log_{4} a$.", "key": "$\\dfrac{-1}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_9_3", "current_skill": "G10_S17_02", "q": "Вычислите: $\\log_3^{2} \\log_{\\frac{1}{5}} \\left( \\frac{1}{125} \\right)$", "key": "$1$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_a", "current_skill": "G10_S22_01", "q": "Вычислите: $4\\cos 150^{\\circ} - \\sin 240^{\\circ} - 3\\tg 210^{\\circ}$", "key": "$-\\dfrac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_b", "current_skill": "G10_S22_01", "q": "Вычислите: $2\\cos 135^{\\circ} + \\tg 60^{\\circ} - \\ctg 240^{\\circ}$", "key": "$\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3} - \\sqrt{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_c", "current_skill": "G10_S22_01", "q": "Вычислите: $\\sin 300^{\\circ} - 3 \\cos 135^{\\circ} + 2 \\cos 210^{\\circ}$", "key": "$-\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2} + \\dfrac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_5_d", "current_skill": "G10_S22_01", "q": "Вычислите: $\\tg 150^{\\circ} - \\ctg 315^{\\circ} + 5\\sin 135^{\\circ}$", "key": "$1 - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} + \\dfrac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_6_a", "current_skill": "G10_S24_04", "q": "Вычислите: $\\tg(7\\pi/6)-2\\tg(5\\pi/3)+3\\tg(11\\pi/6)$", "key": "$\\dfrac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_6_b", "current_skill": "G10_S24_01", "q": "Вычислите: $2\\cos\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right) + \\sin\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{4}\\right) - \\cos\\left(\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\\right)$", "key": "$-\\dfrac{1}{2} - \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$"}, {"id": "G10_TB_3_6_c", "current_skill": "G10_S22_01", "q": "Вычислите: $20\\